For this reason we shall confine our study primarily to W*-algebras in which
the lattice of self-adjoint projections will be used as a substitute for the
Borel sets of the spectrum of an abelian C*-algebra. Usinga theorem of
Takeda [15] we shall be able to extend some of our results to general
C*-algebras.

